{"id":20724,"artist":"Kar by Roger Mac  Sequenced by Barry Taylor","title":"Red River Valley","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:02.02] From this valley they say you are going\n[00:07.42] We will miss your bright eyes and sweet smile\n[00:12.81] For they say you are taking the sunshine\n[00:18.20] That has brightened our path for a while.\n[00:23.60] Come and sit by my side if you love me\n[00:28.99] Do not hasten to bid me adieu\n[00:34.38] But remember the Red River Valley\n[00:39.78] And the cowboy who loved you so true.\n[00:45.17] Won't you think of the valley you're leaving\n[00:50.56] Oh how lonely, how sad it will be?\n[00:55.96] Oh think of the fond heart you're breaking\n[01:01.35] And the grief you are causing to me.\n[01:06.74] Come and sit by my side if you love me\n[01:12.13] Do not hasten to bid me adieu\n[01:17.53] But remember the Red River Valley\n[01:22.92] And the cowboy who loved you so true.\n[01:28.31] As you go to your home by the ocean\n[01:33.71] May you never forget those sweet hours\n[01:39.10] That we spent in the Red River Valley\n[01:44.49] And the love we exchanged mid the flowers\n[01:49.89] Come and sit by my side if you love me\n[01:55.28] Do not hasten to bid me adieu\n[02:00.67] But remember the Red River Valley\n[02:06.07] And the cowboy who loved you so true.\n[02:11.46] But remember the Red River Valley\n[02:16.85] And the cowboy who loved you so true.\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:02.02] <00:02.02>From <00:02.35>this <00:02.69>vall <00:03.37>ey <00:03.70>they <00:04.04>say <00:04.71>you <00:05.05>are <00:05.39>go <00:05.73>ing\n[00:07.41] <00:07.41>We <00:07.75>will <00:08.08>miss <00:08.76>your <00:09.10>bright <00:09.43>eyes <00:10.11>and <00:10.44>sweet <00:10.78>smile\n[00:12.80] <00:12.80>For <00:13.14>they <00:13.48>say <00:14.15>you <00:14.49>are <00:14.83>tak <00:15.50>ing <00:15.84>the <00:16.17>sun <00:16.51>shine\n[00:18.20] <00:18.20>That <00:18.53>has <00:18.87>bright <00:19.55>ened <00:19.88>our <00:20.